#: R/texts.R
msgid "TEFI by level: EGAnetLab compares the entropy fit of the lower-order level with that of the higher-order level. A lower TEFI at the lower level favors correlated dimensions without a hierarchy; a lower TEFI at the higher level favors the hierarchical structure (EGAnetLab calls it bifactor)."
